  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/513",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">문제와 답을 연결하는 게임이다.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">문제와 답을 쌍을 이루게 텍스트 화일에 미리 넣어 주거나 직접 입력하면 프로그램이 자동으로 문제화면을 만들어 준다. &nbsp;</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">만들어진 게임화면을 그림 캡쳐 프로그램을 이용해서 캡쳐한 다음 학습지 한쪽 구석에 넣어 주면, 학생들이 수업시간에 활동을 하게 할 수 있다.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">이 게임은&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); display: inline; float: none; font-family: &amp;quot;맑은 고딕&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">스마트폰 게임 중 flow free 라는 게임과 유사하다.</span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">자신이 원하는 문제와 답을 data 텍스트 화일에 넣어 주어도 되고, 프로그램을 실행시키고 직접 우측 문제와 답 칸에 적어 넣어도 된다. (아래한글로 만들어 복사해서 붙여넣기를 해도 된다.)</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">문제와 답을 적어 넣었으면 아래쪽에서 난이도를 선택하고 문제출제를 눌러 원하는 문제를 만들면 된다. 문제가 마음에 들지 않으면 마음에 들때까지 문제출제를 눌러 다시 만들면 된다.</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">마음에 드는 문제가 나오면 답지감추기 버튼을 눌러 답을 감추고 출제화면을 학습지등에 넣어 활용해 보자.</font></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"480\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile5.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F995565355D4FBD0201C899\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\"></span></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">게임을 푸는 규칙은 간단하다 문제와 답을 선으로 연결하면 된다. 단 연결할때 선이 교차하면 안되고, 사각형 1칸에는 정답화면 처럼 선 1개만 지나가야 한다. 다른 선이 지나간 곳은 지나갈 수 없다.</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">그리고 모든 문제와 답을 연결했을때 남는 공간이 있으면 안된다.</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학습에서 좋은 점은 게임을 하면서 연관된 단어나 문제와 답을 연결하는 동안 계속해서 머릿속으로 반복학습 하게 하는 효과가 있다는 점이다.</font></p><p style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><font style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">아래는 학습지에 넣은 모습</font></p><p style=\"clear: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); float: none; font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; display: inline-block; height: auto; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 5px; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; padding-top: 5px; width: 630px;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"731\" style=\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; cursor: pointer; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile5.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99911E335D4FC72D18E809\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 3.png\"></span></p><p><br></p><p>프로그램은 아래 링크에서 다운 받을 수 있습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2380\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://sciencelove.com/2380</a></p><p><br style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Dotum,Verdana,AppleGothic,Sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
